WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.633 --> 00:00:06.025
PongLens is a coaching workspace built around every student you work with.

2
00:00:09.075 --> 00:00:15.483
Each student has one place for their lesson history, shared notes, recordings and matches, so the full picture stays together.

3
00:00:18.533 --> 00:00:23.237
Keep a coaching journal that shows what you worked on, what changed and what comes next.

4
00:00:26.287 --> 00:00:34.279
Record the lesson as audio, with video recording coming soon. PongLens prepares the transcript and a structured entry for you to review.

5
00:00:37.329 --> 00:00:42.249
Share the parts your student needs, so your coaching stays with them when the session ends.

6
00:00:45.299 --> 00:00:49.547
When they share a match, it sits beside the lessons and notes that led to it.

7
00:00:50.797 --> 00:00:55.621
Watch it point by point, and tie your feedback to the exact rallies that show what you mean.

8
00:00:58.671 --> 00:01:04.575
If you coach remotely, you can also offer paid match reviews with your own scope, price and turnaround.

9
00:01:05.625 --> 00:01:09.945
PongLens. Coaching that carries from one session to the next.
